<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait renews term for Central Bank governor.</title>
<headline>Kuwait renews term for Central Bank governor.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait has renewed a five-year term for its Central Bank governor Sheikh Salem Abdul-Aziz al-Saud al-Sabah, a decree published on Monday said.</p>
<p>Sheikh Salem's current term expires on September 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
